#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:48
#: 32019f3b100e436b8ebba8d9a0783684
msgid "Pinouts"
msgstr "引脚图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:54
#: eb856a1947ce413f81aaf78a13114a18
msgid "UART Defaults"
msgstr "UART默认设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:56
#: f3b144565a564a86ae6f9ac96c8ffdbf
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚图中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:58
#: c78e5b8ac9174edc9b7c95761278ca14
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:59
#: d12e7e03d81b4843958dcc564ec40613
msgid "SERIAL1 -> USART1 (GPS)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> USART1（GPS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:60
#: 5bb21790f4334f8cbb8696aea4d35a1a
msgid "SERIAL2 -> USART2 (RX only,ESC Telemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> USART2（仅RX，ESC数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:61
#: c2d385f95b324f4ba54fb0e1c9b5b97e
msgid "SERIAL3 -> USART3 (DJI, DMA Enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> USART3（DJI，已启用DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:62
#: bfd7f13d94ea4f8c837067842490b486
msgid ""
"SERIAL4 -> UART4 (SBUS pin is inverted and connects to RX pin)(TX DMA "
"Enabled) For normal UART use, :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1."
msgstr ""
"SERIAL4 -> UART4（SBUS引脚经反相后连接到RX引脚）（TX DMA已启用）。普通UART使用请设置 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:63
#: d74ecd18baff4f54b43c98620a90dc1d
msgid ""
"SERIAL5 -> UART5 (RX5 is fed from an inverter connected to DJI connector's "
"SBUS pin, no TX pin)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（RX5来自连接到DJI连接器SBUS引脚的反相器，无TX引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:64
#: a288dc3439c7428ebfcceacc72dbc100
msgid "SERIAL6 -> UART6 (RC serial input, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（RC串行输入，已启用DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:67
#: ad52b1fd8aa647b38441a7bcfef9f0b3
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:69
#: a77054c07e5c4f468215587a7759a846
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the SBUS pin which is inverted and feeds the R4 "
"(UART4_RX) pin for most RC unidirectional protocols, including PPM."
msgstr "遥控输入配置在SBUS引脚上，经反相后馈入R4（UART4_RX）引脚，支持大多数单向遥控协议，包括PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:71
#: cd2c1071817e4e20a391ad52e08cb090
msgid "For CRSF/ELRS/SRXL2 connection of those to UART6 is pre-configured."
msgstr "CRSF/ELRS/SRXL2已预配置连接到UART6。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:73
#: e7cb915c3c2948e79802ff786d6db748
msgid ""
"The DJI connector' SBUS input can be used for SBUS only, but "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\" and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be changed to something other"
" than \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"DJI连接器的SBUS输入仅可用于SBUS，但须将 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` "
"设置为「23」，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 改为「23」以外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:76
#: 34c7af6c3b1e46bc892ebc617924ef65
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:78
#: c394beb797c44f8d8b58a9a9b37788f6
msgid ""
"The FlywooF405 Pro supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The M1 to M4 outputs are on"
" the esc connector and are bi-directional DShot capable, M5 to M8 on solder "
"pads and DShot capable, plus LED pad(PWM output 9) for LED strip or another "
"PWM output."
msgstr ""
"FlywooF405 "
"Pro最多支持9路PWM输出。M1至M4在ESC连接器上，支持双向DShot；M5至M8在焊盘上，支持DShot；另有LED焊盘（PWM输出9）用于LED灯带或其他PWM输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:80
#: 1c9758a4a0054c27a9a5aa966a524d61
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为3组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:82
#: 418f7ef472204790bd91768c230bda0a
msgid "PWM 1-2,5,7 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2、5、7为第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:83
#: 79a84b55c7f24be8b7bde8ba20ac812b
msgid "PWM 3-4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-4为第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:84
#: b4ab5e65869e462098908e13e3f41b79
msgid "PWM 6,8 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 6、8为第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:85
#: 82394e7574804b58b5bb182b22e3fde3
msgid "PWM 9   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 9为第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:87
#: d2b354eb35a4412599368241b87affa5
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output protocol. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 also support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出协议。若某组内任一通道使用DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用DShot。通道1-4还支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:90
#: 28a405a52bed41628cae843d261a934a
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:92
#: 0e2183e0243d4400810ee13f30d0a2f4
msgid ""
"The FlywooF405 Pro outputs can be used as GPIOs (relays, buttons, RPM etc). "
"To use them you need to set the output's ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to -1. See "
":ref:`common-gpios` page for more information."
msgstr ""
"FlywooF405 Pro的输出可用作GPIO（继电器、按钮、转速计等）。使用时需将输出的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"设置为-1。更多信息参见 :ref:`common-gpios` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:94
#: 18af35e0a3de4d8d8320451302394d86
msgid "The numbering of the GPIOs for PIN variables in ArduPilot is:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中 PIN 变量 GPIO 的编号如下："

