#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:109
#: 10a747968b584eac8496c4ec80c71ea7
msgid "An analog input is provided and its reference pin number is \"10\""
msgstr "提供一个模拟输入，其参考引脚编号为「10」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:112
#: 280b9a08c4a9456da43f0cda47f1cb50
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:114
#: c9a612315571447b82387db80edf2752
msgid ""
"The FlywooF405 Pro has an on-board OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =  1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). The CAM and VTX pins provide connections for using the "
"internal OSD."
msgstr ""
"FlywooF405 Pro板载OSD使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = "
"1（MAX7456驱动）。CAM和VTX引脚提供内部OSD的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:117
#: 7f5d5eda46fc4efda937086461d398cd
msgid "DJI Video and OSD"
msgstr "DJI视频和OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:119
#: d0e6b1e93fbe4781ac169d80f15cdd6f
msgid ""
"A JST-GH-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection and SERIAL3 "
"is already setup for this by default.  Pin 1 of the connector is 10v so be "
"careful not to connect this to any peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"一个JST-GH-6P连接器支持标准DJI "
"HD图传连接，SERIAL3已默认配置为此用途。连接器第1针为10V，请注意不要将其连接到任何需要5V的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:122
#: 96d52820cef74999b94b582426751aac
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:124
#: f53d07f294144164bc85dc289c64e30d
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压传感器，ESC 接头上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:126
#: 34f12af78c6648ada078ff1d77039311
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:128
#: 35d956244cce42a5b9597070ae92ec55
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:129
#: fe453159de2c46e082c2310d27a58f18
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:130
#: 74f720ad8d5848af811f490ce2c168ac
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:131
#: d83ed847999b43ca9a0ce186f932db51
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:132
#: 0fef1187b53248d78d1f2a708ee6fb3d
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 58.8 (will "
"need to be adjusted for whichever current sensor is attached)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"58.8（需根据所接电流传感器进行调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:135
#: e0adf48f981a4a87b044c063740aab8a
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:137
#: e3139e9bac884741973440708b261383
msgid ""
"The FlywooF405 Pro does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "FlywooF405 Pro没有内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘的I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:140
#: 63078cd7fcf04719a611836bdd2274ca
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:141
#: 33b3fb9aacd647e583f586b332aad641
msgid ""
"This board does not come with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed. Use "
"instructions here to load ArduPilot the first time :ref:`common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"此飞控板不预装ArduPilot固件。首次加载ArduPilot请参照 :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards` 的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405pro.rst:143
#: cf7d0be8c3244d4e8ddc584ff07888ba
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"FlywooF405Pro\". Firmware is provided only for Copter/Heli but may be "
"built for other vehicles using the `ArduPilot Custom Firmware Build Server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"此飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ "
"的「FlywooF405Pro」子文件夹中找到。固件仅为Copter/Heli提供，但可通过 `ArduPilot自定义固件构建服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ 为其他机型构建。"
